{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/id536cq3tt8l97l19ocyr2odurkjzfi.mp3","text":"您好，接下来负责值班的人是我......您的表情很复杂呢，我看上去有那么不可靠吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/3cwkvpwuijfv7t3g01yndv9enfgp4mp.mp3","text":"我们也不愿意被卷入战场，但其他人活下去的决心也许并没有我们强。要是您能理解这点，就已经足够了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/f4xc7shmgvrzxdavaqg2kxqftencirm.mp3","text":"凛冬、我，还有其他人，其实都不是同一所学校的学生。不过，每座学校里都流传着凛冬的传说，以及“冬将军”这个称号。您难道不觉得，这个称号很酷吗？冬将军，嗯嗯......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/36/3vgfler11ar0ey0xr4gmhqzsxs70lvc.mp3","text":"我们是怎么从切尔诺伯格逃出来的？唔嗯......请别问了，有些答案，您不会喜欢的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/gdry6rsy3tiby0b4vzixlqp1ciuer2w.mp3","text":"哦，我正在读神秘小说......能从那次事件中存活下来，是因为这本书上的东西帮了我很大的忙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/8x4wchhyl8sv7yrxdxyubxlsc6hzh5g.mp3","text":"我最喜欢什么书？政治学、经济学、唯物辩证法......另外，烘焙杂志之类的也不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/63a5xhuaw2196pdsh4ysrnibmkqs1vp.mp3","text":"家？你是说，我们的故乡吗......已经，回不去了吧？您很清楚，那里已经什么都没有了。就算切尔诺伯格能够重建，我也......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/60/ch8xdmihjfdngjbziq1xjhxshbkv2jh.mp3","text":"罗德岛很安全，博士的办公室里又有很多很多书......如果可以的话，我不想离开这里......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/gyvvu05l4o97199w0d7pldttyya9ncn.mp3","text":"将来该怎么办？嗯......不知道，因为没有哪本书会写这种事啊。希望未来能有个人告诉我吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/gcp951e6ivuhon2hizq5jez7qm38rpg.mp3","text":"原来如此，我都没想到呢！“这趟列车中所有的乘客，都是凶手！”","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/c5irtwft4vqs92nghax52wbp4xz85iu.mp3","text":"我是真理，虽然还是一名学生，却因为会使用法术，所以就被招募了......是啊，身为学生却站在这种地方，真是奇怪，不是吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/4jktrqy29jszjkfvx5gb9h2es2zbxgg.mp3","text":"您希望我变强吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/ptqj6pv7t5cazyemhe1fjas7965asq7.mp3","text":"您是不是觉得，您更了解我了？遗憾，还差很远呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/n44pm85mr4lzf7um3vsceoqj5fgfske.mp3","text":"没办法了，就让我展示一下把整个办公室粉碎成沙子的能力吧......开玩笑的，这里还有很多珍贵的书本呢，不能做那样的事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/g8p8t6pl72fhw3okytuhmuyaaznjhia.mp3","text":"我知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/7e38uzbg5s03qe5gbl3nt08t5s3ge55.mp3","text":"各位......嗯，和我想象中的不太一样呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/jx979row9o2vouendh9fiyhwmvjwhxs.mp3","text":"让我们拿出决心、热忱、以及十二万分的热情吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/513i463bfetn2x2s74m3zav6ux8l3q9.mp3","text":"胜利的星，一定会照耀着我们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/7n7ko80ym0bmqtjmxmvt1atm7dteqzm.mp3","text":"博士，什么事？","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/724rxz53i1avqfve7kot4q0cszu9725.mp3","text":"请说吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/ioazu70qvwew2d0qvjqcm5fsbw0d2sn.mp3","text":"真讨厌啊，战场。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/9jk4fkf1cknzorl9so5q5vh1na9ebkk.mp3","text":"只有战斗了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/nw68n5ytgn76y9ff31taqyczlnzzebe.mp3","text":"来吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/646u1h54p10anlfy9tt2j34lv6q2wi2.mp3","text":"请别那么急匆匆的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/hqlt79ngjp7cd8ylmil6lfxw4f8maum.mp3","text":"稍微慢一点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/3cgq1mlh733pq4lxxswr06n02lr1aho.mp3","text":"见识一下吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/57ps7h7fc1evpip8pidemvo8wzesgq2.mp3","text":"为什么，他们哪怕舍弃生命也要战斗......这究竟能换来什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/l25b6ctt97qrazzlqa8rnfkk2u9ayne.mp3","text":"那个，要夸奖我们，也只能趁现在哦......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/178ro713pr8d4kgsdv9sw8pf9nyk95j.mp3","text":"那些逃走的敌人，应该不会再回来了吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/iic56gv94x7dh5crtc6eimm5m7z13ej.mp3","text":"果然，只凭我们是做不到的吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/3dvhjjbwif2tyiw9ykslqqzs7adrl4e.mp3","text":"是一间会发生有趣事件的密室呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/k8pljotvk9z6ri3ohyvge6rlh3fuyp3.mp3","text":"呃......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/e3fbf3ppo1se1eb2edji9uu7d269tgd.mp3","text":"这里好吵啊，我想去博士的办公室看书。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/tw6duz9oph5277mufa02peagkjhllli.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/ls06nfqlaoeugah00vb9u2bbawcq25b.mp3","text":"没有哦，我、我没有醉蜜，只是被索尼娅稍、稍微灌了一点，但我觉得还是应该先来跟您道一声，新年快乐......咦，索尼娅为新年准备了鲜花吗？这个花，为什么会烫手呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/cgw7z00waewrcda6e21d8u7hkdv986t.mp3","text":"你好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_195_glassb/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/g7itgcns3nqltri4n24v5wjt0qoo67v.mp3","text":"您好，接下来负责值班的人是我......您的表情很复杂呢，我看上去有那么不可靠吗？","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/epu6gmzf6mg91wzmy74d4hzf7b5tnhk.mp3","text":"我们也不愿意被卷入战场，但其他人活下去的决心也许并没有我们强。要是您能理解这点，就已经足够了。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/62vtp8qqjw3db3115qwf6sy4t6wdo0e.mp3","text":"凛冬、我，还有其他人，其实都不是同一所学校的学生。不过，每座学校里都流传着凛冬的传说，以及“冬将军”这个称号。您难道不觉得，这个称号很酷吗？冬将军，嗯嗯......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/qnelxrgia33kpqlufi4nnzqnm8oxz1y.mp3","text":"我们是怎么从切尔诺伯格逃出来的？唔嗯......请别问了，有些答案，您不会喜欢的。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/b0j6db1jiyb5dv8tcttluvudmx8rtg3.mp3","text":"哦，我正在读神秘小说......能从那次事件中存活下来，是因为这本书上的东西帮了我很大的忙。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/00/14pyq5fl21rn0s34j5n5p1rg08c7wfm.mp3","text":"我最喜欢什么书？政治学、经济学、唯物辩证法......另外，烘焙杂志之类的也不错。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/jmm4r7chefb3rte8vp57ipgfyr0gmgm.mp3","text":"家？你是说，我们的故乡吗......已经，回不去了吧？您很清楚，那里已经什么都没有了。就算切尔诺伯格能够重建，我也......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/12v4scc1wzb4hnn0cvzxms1duslmkjl.mp3","text":"罗德岛很安全，博士的办公室里又有很多很多书......如果可以的话，我不想离开这里......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/tczp3p7a5sqse5tpalezsmwcv7wqa31.mp3","text":"将来该怎么办？嗯......不知道，因为没有哪本书会写这种事啊。希望未来能有个人告诉我吧......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/c1njd6c3nmjp9rkmdmc1p7botvbcb76.mp3","text":"原来如此，我都没想到呢！“这趟列车中所有的乘客，都是凶手！”","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/7kxvcr6twzey33z7priizg1hj56tqr4.mp3","text":"我是真理，虽然还是一名学生，却因为会使用法术，所以就被招募了......是啊，身为学生却站在这种地方，真是奇怪，不是吗？","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/t5qr7dbmz8uqv34aeyf0p2g9gdcw3d7.mp3","text":"您希望我变强吗？","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/r6zdig1yo09m27pfw0q0yuoixpe1y2c.mp3","text":"您是不是觉得，您更了解我了？遗憾，还差很远呢。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/2ha8tva3lhydmldchhk6fz5fhq0nnza.mp3","text":"没办法了，就让我展示一下把整个办公室粉碎成沙子的能力吧......开玩笑的，这里还有很多珍贵的书本呢，不能做那样的事。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/5z8wonh7kq3fvjamg63w9goe1cqbbde.mp3","text":"我知道了。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/jawr91ahw23jtc71nhdcjdtu1s0vaes.mp3","text":"各位......嗯，和我想象中的不太一样呢。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/okcwiqay1v3wgtrwd5269yrhgfgar0e.mp3","text":"让我们拿出决心、热忱、以及十二万分的热情吧。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/n293x39fu7rtpi57qp3nw6l51tg4i5w.mp3","text":"胜利的星，一定会照耀着我们。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/1eq4zr8zbeefpb30whztrbotqbnpkak.mp3","text":"博士，什么事？","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/71/1edfcqxuryxz1jxckvr65i24c7ktjw8.mp3","text":"请说吧。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/3up1itqs95fteb3wjzyzocxjnwggcrp.mp3","text":"真讨厌啊，战场。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/df/i6cnsfbudbubwh33fqog1jlue86a545.mp3","text":"只有战斗了。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/gk6ok1jw5k39gaed1hcnmqwtcgsmmqh.mp3","text":"来吧。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/a0knynyd3oxqzl3597k53b7wpy1zjhg.mp3","text":"请别那么急匆匆的。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/0o2jmxfgxecug7dqslocu7yujs2kaab.mp3","text":"稍微慢一点。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/li504r0y2z0tchvq4mf2di94qnelynj.mp3","text":"见识一下吧。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/e26b67d7za0ogb1d3l8ty7kbxndh2b0.mp3","text":"为什么，他们哪怕舍弃生命也要战斗......这究竟能换来什么？","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/1rvsdhsbuwhkiho2dcee4577vinmudp.mp3","text":"那个，要夸奖我们，也只能趁现在哦......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/9el0kwq7tpnegu44xpegh8gqnhhrmwy.mp3","text":"那些逃走的敌人，应该不会再回来了吧......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/9v4ul3ce32vhd57gpoqj8gbh6qgksb9.mp3","text":"果然，只凭我们是做不到的吧......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/0iiqs2hax3i2pzkmlvkflcmch5ongbh.mp3","text":"是一间会发生有趣事件的密室呢。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/8lxd5vy3jg29lgrz84gz94k38ciklj1.mp3","text":"呃......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/t3wfrcov911tb6evl81z5f857tq7a72.mp3","text":"这里好吵啊，我想去博士的办公室看书。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/kl8a9b1q84sm79p0zddbu1whk7dbtsa.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/kumbxppng8hnunpcbhw177533vya5hf.mp3","text":"没有哦，我、我没有醉蜜，只是被索尼娅稍、稍微灌了一点，但我觉得还是应该先来跟您道一声，新年快乐......咦，索尼娅为新年准备了鲜花吗？这个花，为什么会烫手呢......","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/1vlzch25t2zcn6j4cmbup81ht21fjfx.mp3","text":"你好，博士。","alt":"voice/char_195_glassb/cn_042.mp3"}]}}